listing:   dp_mpi.cc (with mlp.hpp)
toolchain: mpirun (Open MPI) 4.1.6; g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0
command:   mpic++ -std=c++20 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror -g -DOMPI_SKIP_MPICXX dp_mpi.cc -o dp_mpi; for np in 1 2 4: timeout 60 mpirun --allow-run-as-root --oversubscribe -np $np ./dp_mpi
date:      2026-10-10T00:40:29Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container, 4 logical CPUs; MPI processes on one machine, no GPU)
exit code: 0
